---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Love Patel"
  description="Learn more about Love Patel's background, mission, and experience."
>
  <style>
    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .about-box {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .about-box h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #c79c3b;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about-box p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .profile-img {
      float: right;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-left: 2rem;
      object-fit: cover;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
  </style>

  <main class="container" id="main-content">
    <div class="about-box">
      <h2>🌌 Who I Am</h2>
      <img class="profile-img" src="https://via.placeholder.com/200" alt="Your Photo" />
      <p>
        Hi, I’m Love Patel — an adventurer of thought and science, currently studying Biomedical Engineering at Columbia University. I believe in blending disciplines, questioning the norm, and building a future where passion, intellect, and purpose converge.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work spans from organometallic chemistry and engineering to writing philosophical reflections and designing superhero tech. I’m driven by curiosity, guided by compassion, and endlessly hungry to learn.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-box">
      <h2>💭 My Mission</h2>
      <p>
        I want to craft systems that solve real problems — not just academically, but humanely. Whether it's unlocking energy from biology, building smarter AI, or imagining the school of the future, everything I build is guided by a singular goal: to leave the world richer, kinder, and more curious than I found it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-box">
      <h2>🧬 Experience & Education</h2>
      <p>
        I’m currently a student at Columbia University, majoring in Biomedical Engineering with minors in Philosophy, Political Science, and Entrepreneurship. I conduct inorganic chemistry research in the Norton Lab and am preparing for the MCAT and LSAT.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’ve written for legal journals, led student policy initiatives, and I’m building personal tech projects ranging from energy storage to AI autonomy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
